# Lab safety

Do **not** run mutating AWS CLI or IaC deploy/destroy while authoring this repo.
Author commands in docs/scripts; the human runs the lab.

Opt-in (operator only):

```bash
export GG_EDGE_ALLOW_AWS=1
```

Read-only `aws` (`describe` / `list` / `get` / `sts get-*`) is fine.
Never commit certs, private keys, or a live `walkthrough.env`.

Details: `.kiro/steering/lab-safety.md`, hook `.kiro/hooks/guard-aws-mutations.py`.
